# B-520: recursive function defined inside intermediate dict of a multi-body function.
# Exercises the Sequential handler path (infer_dict for intermediate dicts).
# count is self-referential — the intermediate dict must be letrec-scoped.
[
  outer: [fn [let n]
    [count: [fn [let x] [if [= x 0] 0 [+ 1 [count [- x 1]]]]]]
    [count n]]
  result: [outer 5]
]
=== out
Dict({"outer": Fn, "result": Int(5)})
